--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_CerednikDrinfeld_CosetGraph_mul_self_mem_level_and_not_mem_level_and_mem_inf_conj_iff_of_mem_primeHeckeSet.lean

